t other girls don't have."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"Most of her actions are not entirely honest and stems from the fact that she is quite desperate to get a lover due to her hermaphrodite status. Marika plays major role in most of the bad endings through her own trap to fulfill her mother nefarious goal."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From JAST USA"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c14525"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/a9/a9ac09d93c1fb29a387b0d79af0139c58e08cde367d144ccc49d39ee90fc7dca.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/63/631fabca2505eb0017c65e68fa1ca545ae0a505b6f9c8514e61f4cf39359b8be.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"一色 ヒカル","creatorId":"vndb:s6","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s6","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6","name":"田中 涼子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:22464","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c14526","characterName":"間宮 麻理沙","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c14526"},"originalCharacterName":"間宮 麻理沙","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The younger daughter of the Mamiya family, the self-centered Marisa is at times cold and cruel even as she brings you great pleasure. She loves to relieve stress by using the servants of the mansion sexually and always has something special for you to do in the mornings."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From JAST USA"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c14526"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/d6/d6dbd68c9042b2e16245741086a333ce50d254b74d9a4f116791f16243a73ddc.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/b6/b66959ad55d14ac7faa0bbbceff35da7d45f086628151faff1c2b38067659cb6.webp","width":218,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"長谷部 雪奈","creatorId":"vndb:s1021","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s1021","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s1021","name":"長谷部 雪奈","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:22471","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c14527","characterName":"朝霧 幸恵","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c14527"},"originalCharacterName":"朝霧 幸恵","characterNameSource":null,"role":"primary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Another servant at the Mamiya Manor, she is your senpai, and always does her best to show you the ropes so you don't feel too lost. She wants one thing from her role at the mansion, and that's money. She's a good person, but when her financial life is threatened she can change in a heartbeat."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"She actually has been working for the Mamiyas in order to find a way to rob the estate which she may coerce Sawatari into helping her. Despite her greediness and laziness Sachie can also be honorable and she is the only person who can help both Sawatari and Mitarai leaves the mansion together alive."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"From JAST USA"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c14527"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ea/ea157de66a5682042e40efd0a84fe5e7989d5239d891d70a05dcedd2f671541b.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/15/158d0d437b9f4e79712c63bb688b3d4a231535c2b1608703112ec77a8655d450.webp","width":218,"height":256,"