rimary","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"m"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"The son of Mikako, he's living as a servant at the mansion, the same as you, and is often called to perform sexual acts with Mamiya family and their friends. He's a very eager worker, always eager to please and be pleased."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"In truth, he and his mother are slaves to the Mamiyas due to their family's restaurant debt. Once the deadline pasts, the two will be sold through Marie's auction event in which he will be bid by Yukari and turned into her sex slave."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From JAST USA"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c14529"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/f9/f9c297d9a6c52cf87acf5a93385733786e235af5cacff52b86eb45c2d7200373.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/c4/c4c9c24070b064b201a51105f356b32809c06bec971ecb696c32221582a04b82.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"榎津 まお","creatorId":"vndb:s106","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s106","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s106","name":"野中 カオリ","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:22466","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c14530","characterName":"君島 由香里","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c14530"},"originalCharacterName":"君島 由香里","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"One of the few friends of Marie, Yukari is a fabulously rich woman and celebrity who often plays with the Mamiyas sexually, relieving her stress whenever she feels the urge. She has a perverse nature that's second only to Marie."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"A sadistic woman, Yukari enjoy owning several young male slaves which she often gets rid off when losing interest. She eventually will bid Makoto in the auction event and may become Sawatari's new Mistress should he fall to Marie's trap."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From JAST USA"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c14530"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":{"url":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/ee/ee61045d3373eb6663ab3b1648f7405f2067053582fbdbb48a10e8b586feb39f.webp","fallbackUrl":"https://wiki-assets.bishojo.date/terminal-wiki/v1/characters/v1/images/bd/bd2f6361c72ee4d71cc8db76641857b0df96b01e5d1660ab5781b42bccbe7f42.webp","width":213,"height":256,"source":"static-detail"},"actors":[{"creditedName":"一色 ヒカル","creatorId":"vndb:s6","sourcePersonId":"vndb:s6","canonicalEntityId":"vndb:s6","name":"田中 涼子","roleCode":"voice-actor","roleLabel":"声优","identityStatus":"source-native","relationId":"vndb:vn-seiyuu:22465","source":"vndb"}]},{"characterId":"char_vndb_c14531","characterName":"フランチェスカ・マティ","sourceIds":{"vndbCharacterId":"c14531"},"originalCharacterName":"フランチェスカ・マティ","characterNameSource":null,"role":"side","status":"source-only-candidate","identityStatus":"source-authoritative","metadata":{"sex":{"reviewState":"source-only","source":"vndb","value":"f"}},"descriptions":[{"segments":[{"spoiler":false,"text":"Another friend of Marie's, she's a wealthy woman with extravagant sexual tastes, which she explores alongside Yukari. A foreigner, she has an affinity for using male sperm as a way of preserving her youthful appearance."},{"spoiler":true,"text":"In the past, she accidentally killed one of Yukari's servants after over injecting sexual stimulant."},{"spoiler":false,"text":"From JAST USA"}],"source":"vndb","sourceCharacterId":"c14531"}],"profileFacts":[],"metadataCandidateConflicts":{},"image":